Package: dbAudit
Type: Package
Title: Audit Manually Entered Laboratory and Monitoring Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Alejandro", "Verri Kozlowski", , "averri@fi.uba.ar",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8535-1170"))
Description: Parses and audits data entered by hand before it reaches a
    report: laboratory geochemical certificates, piezometer spreadsheets,
    and inclinometer survey exports. Corrections are applied at ingest
    with the original value retained, unresolved defects are recorded as
    a work list traceable to file and row, and no record is discarded.
